.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Word/Office lock files — these appear in class folders and must never be committed
~$*

# Your own filled-in context is yours; uncomment these if you fork this repo to hold
# your real setup and want to keep the pack private.
# Context/school-profile.md
# Context/teaching-beliefs.md
# Context/writing-style.md
# Context/curriculum/*
# !Context/curriculum/README.md
# Context/exemplars/*
# !Context/exemplars/README.md
# Context/templates/*
# !Context/templates/README.md
# Context/_source/

# Never commit anything from the class side. If you ever put a git repo near student
# work, these are the lines that matter — and do not add a remote.
_reports/
students/
*.docx
*.doc
